/data/*
*.csv
*.parquet
!/data/btcusd_spot_5m.csv.gz
# real Binance BTCUSDT perp funding, charged as a first-class cost
!/data/btcusdt_perp_funding_8h.csv.gz
# Deribit BTC-PERPETUAL funding, 2020-2026; covers the post-2023 gap the
# Binance series leaves (Binance is unreachable from these sessions)
!/data/btcusdt_deribit_perp_funding_8h.csv.gz
# Bitfinex ETH/BTC 2016-2019, for the cross-asset falsification test
!/data/ethusd_bitfinex_5m.csv.gz
!/data/btcusd_bitfinex_5m.csv.gz
!/data/btcusdt_perp_5m.csv
!/data/btcusdt_spot_aligned_5m.csv
# real Deribit BTC/ETH-PERPETUAL 5m price (B-15): the first genuinely
# independent second price series this repo has had, so the spot/perp
# basis stops being identically zero by construction
!/data/btcusdt_deribit_perp_5m.csv.gz
!/data/ethusdt_deribit_perp_5m.csv.gz
# real Coinbase ETH-USD spot 5m, spanning ETH-PERPETUAL's full history
# (the existing Bitfinex ETH file stops in 2019-12)
!/data/ethusd_coinbase_spot_5m.csv.gz
# daily on-chain metrics (B-07): the first price-independent information
# channel this project has had, from CoinMetrics' free community API
!/data/btc_onchain_daily.csv.gz
!/data/eth_onchain_daily.csv.gz
# daily macro/cross-asset series (R-53): S&P 500, VIX and the Fed broad
# dollar index from FRED - the first information channel describing the
# rest of the financial system rather than the traded asset itself
!/data/spx_daily.csv.gz
!/data/vix_daily.csv.gz
!/data/dxy_daily.csv.gz
# daily aggregate USDT circulating supply (R-54): a crypto-native
# liquidity-flow signal, from CoinMetrics' free community API
!/data/stablecoin_supply_daily.csv.gz
# daily BTC DVOL, Deribit's official 30-day implied-volatility index
# (R-73): the first forward-looking, market-PRICED information channel
# this project has had, as opposed to a spot/balance-sheet flow proxy.
# History starts ~2021-03-24 -- a hard data limitation, not a bug.
!/data/btc_dvol_daily.csv.gz
# daily ETH DVOL (R-73 conservative): fetched alongside BTC DVOL so the
# variance-risk-premium brake's pre-registered ETH falsification test
# uses a genuine asset-specific implied-vol index rather than proxying
# ETH's VRP through BTC's own DVOL. Same 2021-03-24 start.
!/data/eth_dvol_daily.csv.gz
# daily MVRV ratio (market cap / realized cap), BTC and ETH (R-74): a
# valuation-based on-chain signal from CoinMetrics' free community API,
# structurally different from every prior INFO channel (not a flow like
# stablecoin supply, not a priced vol expectation like DVOL, not a
# spillover from equities/FX like VIX/DXY, not raw network activity like
# active-address growth)
!/data/btc_mvrv_daily.csv.gz
!/data/eth_mvrv_daily.csv.gz
# the six-instrument Coinbase panel (R-57), plus the XRP series its own
# continuity rule excludes - committed rather than regenerated because the
# panel IS the evidence for the scope of this project's drawdown finding,
# and because a future candidate can now be failed on six independent
# instruments before a holdout consultation is spent on it
!/data/bchusd_coinbase_spot_5m.csv.gz
!/data/ltcusd_coinbase_spot_5m.csv.gz
!/data/etcusd_coinbase_spot_5m.csv.gz
!/data/dashusd_coinbase_spot_5m.csv.gz
!/data/linkusd_coinbase_spot_5m.csv.gz
!/data/xtzusd_coinbase_spot_5m.csv.gz
!/data/xrpusd_coinbase_spot_5m.csv.gz
# Binance USDS-M futures positioning metrics (open interest + long/short
# ratios, R-81): a derivatives-positioning "crowding" signal at the SAME
# 5-minute cadence as this project's own bars, unlike every prior INFO
# feed (all daily-or-coarser). BTC from 2020-09-01, ETH from 2021-12-01
# (a DVOL-like short-history caveat, stated in load_binance_metrics).
!/data/btcusdt_perp_metrics_5m.csv.gz
!/data/ethusdt_perp_metrics_5m.csv.gz
/reports/*
!/reports/comparison.md
!/reports/comparison.csv
