# B-06 forward paper-trading recorder (scripts/paper_trade.py). Unlike every
# other reports/ subdir this one is not a regenerable analysis output - it
# grows by exactly one row per closed candle and IS the record; there is no
# `tradebot run` that reproduces it. Commit it anyway, growth and all: it is
# the only uncontaminated evidence this project can still generate once the
# 2023+ holdout's consultation count exhausts deflated Sharpe (docs/LEDGER.md).
!/reports/paper_trading/
!/reports/paper_trading/*.json
!/reports/paper_trading/*.csv
# the cross-asset panel round (R-57). Same reasoning as matched_hold: the
# per-cell numbers are what VALIDATION.md's tables cite, and the run log is
# the receipt that the pre-registered rules were read in the order claimed.
!/reports/cross_asset_panel/
!/reports/cross_asset_panel/*.csv
!/reports/cross_asset_panel/*.png
!/reports/cross_asset_panel/*.txt
# R-59 (B-25): per-cell numbers behind both branches' reports, same
